---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section id="about" eyebrow="My Story" title="About">
  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-ink-subtle leading-relaxed text-base">
    <p>
      I'm a data scientist working at the intersection of applied machine
      learning and generative AI. My focus is turning messy, real-world data
      into systems that make decisions people can trust.
    </p>
    <p>
      Most recently I've been evaluating agentic frameworks and running
      technical discovery for enterprise Generative AI products — figuring out
      what these systems can actually do, where they break, and how to ship them
      responsibly. Before moving into ML, I spent several years in strategy and
      technology consulting, which shapes how I connect models to outcomes.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>
